The Shrewd Dude wrote:

> By the way, how do you coax the Oracle to send you to Sokoban? 

You don't.

> Do I 
> kill her or just consult a lot? 

It's unwise to kill her; she's peaceful. You can consult a lot if you have
money and want information, but to reach Sokoban that's not necessary:
all you need to do to find Sokoban is to go downstairs from the Oracle
level and find the other up staircase.

> Is there any use for 2 BoH's? as I 
> already found one.

Don't carry two; the risk of accidentally putting one into the other is
too great. Stash the spare one somewhere safe that you can remember (the
first level of Sokoban is a good place) in case something happens to the
one you're carrying.

There's a 50% chance, by the way, that Sokoban will leave you with *three*
bags of holding...

